	"changelog": "\n= 2026.09.09 =\n- Initial release.\n- Speaks automatically as soon as NVDA finishes starting, with no key press required.\n- Default greeting is time-of-day aware (good morning, afternoon, or evening).\n- Add your own custom messages instead of the default greeting; if you add more than one, a different one is spoken each time NVDA starts.\n- Adds an \"NVDA Startup Greeter\" category to NVDA Settings to enable/disable the greeting or manage your custom messages.\n- Also shows a matching message on a connected braille display.\n",
